    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead6b5ed4afb6ed140cba9bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "悠悠的身体是白色的，它应该也会喜欢白花吧？\n还是红色比较好？那边还有黄色的花朵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a15a3b9a31fc20d85c4f5a3bd48f4ed309bc368e4cd1d14363ced6679e7370a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
