      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼……呼……呼～\n好，跑完外围了！真弓，我们回操场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "202a43eff0bf963ef0a9d2153f585115997c3b6fe3a1c772607b8beba4c9bb7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
