      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车最值得安心信赖。\n你永远都会在我内心的天空中飞翔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1973f647353024adff37d772b050e989ad05ef03954a2289a02603f55bb335a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
