    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a25e3cfb98042f77a15858",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此，所以你觉得我很“坚强”啊。\n的确，大部分的人面对死亡时都会很悲伤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6888021576abc39918cbaec4b50bc07cee9bc3fb299fa8e95d549de5bab9f3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
