      "uid": "zhcn:96227efcc3098e2f39e681b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我妈妈是医生，所以真弓从小就把医院当成公园玩耍。\n医院里流动着生命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a1082a47c11fcfe9559a945e172cda3c0b1dab1c68be79c226cceba0318183c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
